# version05: EmuDESK About box at 1920x1080, no card. gen_script.py assumes a
# 640x480 screen; three parkbr sweeps saturate the pointer at the real corner
# (1919,1079) while the generator believes (639,479), so every target below is
# written in generator coordinates T = real - (1280,600):
#   (26,300) -> T(-1254,-300)   approach the Desk title from below, no other title crossed
#   (26,9)   -> T(-1254,-591)   hover "Desk" -> drop-down
#   (60,28)  -> T(-1220,-572)   first entry "About NewTOS..."; click
100 parkbr
106 parkbr
112 parkbr
200 move -1254 -300
400 mark A00_IDLE
500 move -1254 -591
900 mark A01_DESK_OPEN
1000 move -1220 -572
1200 down
1203 up
2200 mark A02_ABOUT
